WEBVTT

00:09:29.196 --> 00:09:30.876
or "health insurance."

00:09:32.076 --> 00:09:37.676
Insurance ads rarely show you
sick people, smashed cars, torn suitcase.

00:09:37.716 --> 00:09:39.756
The message is loud and clear:

00:09:39.756 --> 00:09:41.276
You have insurance,

00:09:41.316 --> 00:09:43.796
all is well in the world.

00:09:45.556 --> 00:09:49.196
However, to get us to buy insurance,

00:09:49.236 --> 00:09:53.116
the promoters must also work our fears.

00:09:54.716 --> 00:09:58.276
Which is why, right after
you paid a lot of money

00:09:58.276 --> 00:10:00.796
for a top of the line refrigerator,